Move the base image to alpine 3.24, which raises python from 3.12 to 3.14. The pinned python dependencies are refreshed to versions that build against it, including marshmallow 4 and its updated hook and context APIs. Bcrypt stays on 4.x because Passlib 1.7.4 does not handle bcrypt 5 rejecting passwords longer than 72 bytes. PHP stays on 8.4: alpine 3.24 makes php85 its default, but roundcube 1.6 is not compatible with it.
